{"id":"74fb66317994","publishedAt":1795856400000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"榊菜吟元女流１級、育成会Ｂ１昇級　女流棋士に復帰の見込み"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-21.html","text":"ニュース"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/28"},{"text":"09:00"},{"text":"10"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"https://t.co/5vo6aQaUVa"},{"size":13,"text":"\n\n関西研修会更新（11/22対局分）\n引退規定に該当し\n7月から研修会員（B2）となっていた\n榊菜吟元女流1級が規定成績を挙げ\n女流棋士資格獲得となるB1昇級\n女流棋士として復帰の見込み"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"— あさねぼう (@asanebou13) "},{"size":13,"href":"https://x.com/asanebou13/status/2125771478448971996?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 26, 2026"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"}],[{"size":13,"text":"\n榊　11/22 "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" ○　鈴江 "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" ●　大野 "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" ●　杉立 "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" ○　キラリ "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" で何とかB1昇格 "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" 48対局目を満たす来月まではやるのかね "},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":" B2には落ちないのも確定したけど\n"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"color":"#0033CC","text":">>556"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" おお、復帰できそうなのね "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 良かった良かった "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1795248085/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24137.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24137.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24137.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24137.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(10)"}]],"comments":[]}